    "alt": "在溫馨明亮的兒童臥室裡，小男孩坐在書桌前整理書包，媽媽在一旁溫柔微笑陪伴，書桌上擺放著打開的書包、課本、筆記本、鉛筆與直尺。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo gets "
        },
        {
          "text": "ready",
          "wordIds": [
            "ready"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " for school the next day."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 正在為隔天上學做準備。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/packing-schoolbag/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "3dfe6e8c1e2bd64a1ab87aa25e534b86d202014bd474c0225dbf515ad8c8db44",
        "sha256": "22bc6f2d1237465290af74a52e599b45b9942651c760e3ddba41ff6a7798dfcd"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom comes into the room and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Are you ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "are-you-ready"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ready",
          "phraseIds": [
            "are-you-ready"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "ready"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "are-you-ready"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽走進房間並問道：「你準備好了嗎？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/packing-schoolbag/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "d1c4c887ec42983f379c83a12229506c364321fe2d63a8f26b0467b003b39eae",
        "sha256": "708295bbb8ad4236b613be7bb321ea45df8dfa33fb149705cd1898366163f0b5"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo checks his items and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Where is my ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "where-is-my-notebook"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "notebook",
          "phraseIds": [
            "where-is-my-notebook"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "notebook"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "where-is-my-notebook"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 檢查要帶的物品並問道：「我的筆記本在哪裡？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/packing-schoolbag/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "4769604af475c468107ca046273b9d28b9903ddb409849a972976ca976e5b190",
        "sha256": "dbb7a767f50022a0cfc3a1350fea06e1c7ed8bb73fbb3feb1214b37d667d0b07"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom finds it beside an English "
        },
        {
          "text": "book",
          "wordIds": [
            "book"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Here it is!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "here-it-is"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽在英文課本旁邊找到它，並說道：「在這裡！」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/packing-schoolbag/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "d0e4c29c62ff990c8f8c5042aa267bcae4078cae6ddeb416faa17a15783c65f6",
        "sha256": "9a568c991bcc20696a891f550e6dc7d07bada7528e4c4e8906b7de3b0ed2785b"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She hands it to Leo with a smile and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Put it in the bag.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "put-it-in-the-bag"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "她微笑著遞給 Leo 並說道：「把它放進書包裡。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/packing-schoolbag/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "3a1514eae08c3fa8a78ac87221b015dac363331272df3d5f29ff255dc5704d3f",
        "sha256": "c6e807a0e2b11651a5f99abcdc0eefc95d447e6fd873466d642e00779c70f20e"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo finds his "
        },
        {
          "text": "ruler",
          "wordIds": [
            "ruler"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", then puts his "
        },
        {
          "text": "pencil",
          "wordIds": [
            "pencil"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "text": "notebook",
          "wordIds": [
            "notebook"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " inside the "
        },
        {
          "text": "schoolbag",
          "wordIds": [
            "schoolbag"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 找到了他的尺，接著把鉛筆和筆記本放進書包裡。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/packing-schoolbag/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "bbf56418f1d3d0e0f5b054059332ccdc445d42eb2878583136e06eee89d86dad",
        "sha256": "2904bd2bbde87d75e5242e4bfaedab6cfc052655269b165b1d766dfbbb31e11b"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Everything is "
        },
        {
          "text": "ready",
          "wordIds": [
            "ready"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", so he zips up the "
        },
        {
          "text": "schoolbag",
          "wordIds": [
            "schoolbag"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "每樣東西都準備好了，於是他拉上書包的拉鍊。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/packing-schoolbag/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "40c2d9476f4ff43b8dcda7c48ef0d0b6411e0d037b1f95f19066c15e444036fc",
